/-!
# GST CLASSICAL HODGE — PRIMITIVE INCIDENCE PLANE COMPLETENESS

The common-class and trace formulations still package a cohomological relation
as an input.  The exact base commit already contains a lower geometric layer:
`StrictlyMaterializedBranch`.  Its witness is not a target algebraicity proof.
It consists of a genuine bi-finite closed correspondence, its Betti kernel,
point fundamental classes, and the low-level incidence primitives, together
with the equality saying that this independently constructed kernel action is
the GST branch action.  The repository has already proved from those
primitives that the action preserves the actual cycle-class range.

This file therefore lowers GST plane completeness one more level.  We require
materialization only for the source-to-target branch events that are actually
used by basis reconstruction, not for every edge of the omniverse.  The Hodge
conclusion is reconstructed directly from range preservation.  No
`BettiRelated`, finite trace, common plane class, separator ghost, target cycle,
or target algebraicity witness is assumed.

The historical ghost-indexed plane packages then become downstream theorems.
The only remaining geometric construction boundary is explicit and local:
materialize the certified source-to-target GST events by the primitive
incidence carrier already defined in the omniverse.
-/

set_option maxHeartbeats 180000000
set_option maxRecDepth 1000000

noncomputable section

